    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data. our services support pseudonymisation and data minimisation. our have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register. our data processing agreements (DPAs) are aligned with GDPR Article 28. our also ensure configurable retention aligned to legal archival obligations. our security controls include secure software development lifecycle practices such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider of equivalent CREST level. our have a vulnerability management process in place with remediation SLAs by severity and an incident response plan that includes detection, notification, and remediation, following the 72-hour GDPR breach-notification workflow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our certifications, data protection measures, security controls, and experience with the EU regulatory frameworks, our can ensure compliance with the client's requirements for strict GDPR compliance. compliance with the client's requirements for strict GDPR compliance includes hosting data within the EU, not transferring data outside the EU, protecting sensitive data through encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant, and providing a complete audit trail and explainability. our SecNumCloud qualification, which is held at the hosting layer through our partnership with OuraneCloud, supports sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. supports aligns with the client's requirements for data sovereignty and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, based on our company context, our can indeed ensure compliance with the client's specified security and regulatory requirements related to GDPR and data protection." ;
