        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, I propose a technical architecture that leverages our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, Atelier, to meet The client demands.  our will deploy our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, Atelier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, ensuring sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup allows our to provide high availability during business hours and resilience to seasonal peak loads, thanks to OuraneCloud scalable infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve response times below 2 seconds for common queries, our will utilize our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, Atelier, orchestration layer, which routes a query through retrieval, generation, and post-processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The vector store and retrieval layer with hybrid search capabilities will enable fast and accurate information retrieval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with The client production tools, our will utilize our API-first approach (REST + webhook) and provide documented APIs that can be embedded in existing work environments. our business tool integration capabilities include connectors and adapters for accounting-production software, payroll software, document management / GED, and electronic-invoicing / dematerialisation environment, which are all required by The client. our will also ensure seamless integration with the user directory (SSO) using our supported identity protocols, such as SAML and OIDC." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, Atelier, containerization using Kubernetes will provide the necessary scalability and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

